# Mirror of the golden-output guard in the root .prettierignore, relative
# to this directory. `agentrs f` runs prettier with cwd here, where the
# root ignore never applies — without this file every format pass
# rewrites compiler-emitted goldens into prettier dialect and reddens
# the suites (the 2026-09-20 formatter war). Goldens are compared
# exactly; only the compiler regen (per-pair attested) may change them.
modules/*/tests/cases/**/output/
